      "An automatic pool cover is one of the most satisfying upgrades a pool owner can make, and also one of the most misunderstood from a budgeting standpoint. The purchase price is only the beginning. Like a car, a boat, or a high-end appliance, an automatic system has wearable components that need periodic attention, and owners who plan for those costs enjoy years of trouble-free operation while owners who ignore them face expensive surprises. This guide breaks down realistic maintenance and repair costs so you can decide with clear eyes whether an automatic cover belongs in your plan.",
